<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">setdesc</ansi>

The <ansi fg="command">setdesc</ansi> command sets your character's description.
This is what other players see when they look at you.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">setdesc</ansi>                  Show your current description.
  <ansi fg="command">setdesc <text></ansi>            Set a new description.
  <ansi fg="command">setdesc clear</ansi>             Reset to default.

Write in third person — describe what someone sees when they
look at your character. Your description is automatically
word-wrapped for MUD display.

<ansi fg="yellow">Example: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">setdesc A tall figure with sun-weathered skin and
  calloused hands. A faded scar runs from their left
  temple to their jaw, half-hidden by unkempt hair.</ansi>

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help look</ansi>
